# Lagged Seasonal Deficit of Biodegradable Organics in a Hot-Climate Sewer

This repository contains the data and analysis code used to investigate seasonal variations in biodegradable organic matter within a municipal wastewater system and to evaluate the role of temperature-driven sewer processes. The workflow reproduces all analytical results presented in the associated study, including seasonal diagnostics, temperature-response analyses, process-model evaluation, and design-factor calculations.

