Running the Analysis

Install the required Python packages and execute the full workflow:

pip install -r requirements.txt
python run_all.py


The complete analysis typically requires approximately one minute on a standard laptop.

Analysis Workflow

The scripts are executed in the following order by run_all.py.

Script	Purposeanalysis.py	Computes daily load time series, seasonal climatology, seasonal phase relationships, lag analyses, season-adjusted temperature tests, dissolved oxygen and solids diagnostics, Ramadan event analyses, robustness assessments, and Hannovil plant statistics.
era5_check.py	Evaluates consistency between plant temperature measurements and ERA5 air temperature data, performs lag analyses using ERA5 forcing, and conducts season-adjusted temperature tests.
sewer_model.py	Implements sewer-temperature transfer modelling, kinetics-only and biomass-memory process models, parameter estimation, sensitivity analyses, out-of-sample validation, and per-capita consistency checks.
supp_checks.py	Performs additional diagnostic and validation analyses supporting interpretation of dissolved oxygen behaviour and model timing characteristics.
design_factors.py	Calculates monthly wastewater feedstock design factors and associated uncertainty estimates.
