hannovil.xlsx

Monthly laboratory monitoring data from the Hannovil (Alagamy) wastewater treatment plant (2008–2009), used for independent comparative analyses.

Notes
A known sensor issue affects the plant temperature series during 2004. Consequently, ERA5-derived temperature data are used for inferential temperature analyses.
Ramadan dates used in the event-study analyses are specified directly within the analysis scripts.
Population-based calculations in the sewer model assume service to Ismailia City, using census-based demographic estimates and interpolation between census years.
Reproducibility

All analyses are deterministic. Fixed random seeds are used wherever permutation testing or Monte Carlo procedures are applied, ensuring exact reproducibility of reported numerical results.


This version focuses entirely on the **data, analysis, modelling workflow, and reproducibility**, while removing all references to manuscript preparation, figure generation, graphical abstracts, and document-production scripts.
